  "question": "Which two numbers should be interchanged to make the given equation correct? \n\n75 ÷ 5 + 15 × 4 - 17 × 3 + (60 ÷ 6) × 10 = 100\n\n(Note: Interchange should be done of the entire number and not individual digits of a given number.)",
