  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven : 75 ÷ 5 + 15 × 4 - 17 × 3 + (60 ÷ 6) × 10 = 100\n\nAccording to the question, after replacing the numbers: \n\nOption 1) 5 and 3\n\n75 ÷ 5 + 15 × 4 - 17 × 3 + (60 ÷ 6) × 10 = 100 ⇒ 75 ÷ 3 + 15 × 4 - 17 × 5 + (60 ÷ 6) × 10 = 100\n\n⇒ 75 ÷ 3 + 15 × 4 - 17 × 5 + __**(60 ÷ 6)**__ × 10 = 100\n\n⇒ __**75 ÷ 3**__ + 15 × 4 - 17 × 5 + 10 × 10 = 100\n\n⇒ 25 + __**15 × 4**__ - __**17 × 5**__ + __**10 × 10**__ = 100\n\n⇒ 25 + 60 + 100</stron",
